      "name": "AllTheLootRedux",
      "slug": "allthelootredux",
      "teaser": "This is AllTheLoot for spt 3.11. It works too and shouldn't have issues that I know of at least",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2768.png",
      "downloads": 18507,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>AllTheLoot Redux – SPT 3.11 Original by: BlackMamba / lElwoodBluesl &amp; jewels Redux for 3.11 by: h3ticnade This is an updated redux of the legendary AllTheLoot mod, originally created by BlackMamba (lElwoodBluesl) and further refined by jewels. Fully compatible with SPT 3.11, this version brings the madness and variety of loot spawns back to life for the current patch.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instructions</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>To install the mod simply download the file, extract, open it, drag and drop the “user” file into your spt directory</p></div></div></div>\n<h4>🔧 Features:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Loot pool overhaul: nearly every item in the game has a chance to spawn in the world</li>\n<li>Overhauled spawn categories and probabilities</li>\n<li>Balanced chaos — loot everywhere, but not <em>too</em> much</li>\n<li>Freshly updated for SPT 3.11</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📦 Credits:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>BlackMamba / lElwoodBluesl</strong> – Creator of the original AllTheLoot mod</li>\n<li><strong>jewels</strong> – Community contributor and balance tuning</li>\n<li><strong>h3ticnade</strong> – Redux and patching for 3.11 compatibility</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></a></p>\n<p>Yeah I know it is the video for sain, I’m not making a mod specific gif its all the same the names are just different.</p>\n<p>Yeah I used AI for making this description and the photo, I did in fact edit the necessary files myself though</p>\n<p><em>This is a community redux. All credit for the original concept and implementation goes to the above authors. I’ve just ensured the fun continues in 3.11.</em></p>\n",
